# Design Narrative
# Mechanic: Suppress the Blight branch when no controlled creature can receive its counter.
# Forcing: The human controls only lands, so the mana branch is the only payable additional cost.
# AI behavior: The scripted human path has one spell target and no cost-selection choice.
# Failure modes:
#   WIN = the mana branch resolves and exiles the target.
#   LOSE = the spell did not complete before the turn limit.
#   TIMEOUT = an invalid Blight choice or another prompt blocked the game.
# Card roles:
#   Bogslither's Embrace — exposes the Blight-or-mana additional cost.
#   Centaur Courser — deterministic spell target.
# Protocol path: Cast proceeds directly to SelectTargetsReq without a Blight CastingTimeOptionsReq.
# Paired with: blight-bogslither-positive.pzl
[metadata]
Name:Bogslither's Embrace Mana Branch
Goal:Win
Turns:2
Difficulty:Easy
Description:With no controlled creature, cast Bogslither's Embrace using its mana branch and exile Centaur Courser.

[state]
ActivePlayer=Human
ActivePhase=Main1
HumanLife=20
AILife=20

humanhand=Bogslither's Embrace
humanbattlefield=Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp;Swamp
humanlibrary=Swamp
aibattlefield=Centaur Courser
ailibrary=Mountain
